  "answer": "The NCCL error \"unhandled system error\" during `ncclCommInitRank` in vLLM distributed serving is caused by a missing `IPC_LOCK` Linux capability or an unmounted `/dev/shm`. This issue is resolved by enabling GPUDirect RDMA and ensuring proper environment configuration."
